{
"finding": "Existing contracts supply deterministic arm ordering, explicit per-arm repetition mapping and lossless byte retention; multiple attempts produce zero completion with unresolved selection. No automatic retry, favorable substitution, real admission or runtime stopping implementation is authorized. This prospective supplement supplies dispatch/stop decisions only.",
"legacy_compatibility": "No record/manifest schema, required null reason, old checker, fixed synthetic fixture, denominator or past result changes. The existing synthetic attempt envelope remains synthetic-only with verification not_performed, real_admission blocked and attempt_selection unresolved. A policy rejection is a separate audit decision, not an envelope selection.",
"budget": "Named sources and selected JSON contracts only; one additional linked protocol baseline section clarified matched-budget/completion requirements. No payload catalogs, keys, historical suites or further broad reads."
}
